{"format": "mmf", "type": "score", "version": "1.1", "app": "V2.7.87", "intelligentBeams": 1, "created": "2026-08-26T20:02:50.312Z", "system": "Tonal", "keySignature": "Ab", "keyChanges": [], "timeChanges": [], "octaveLines": [], "si": {"identified": true, "confidence": "alta", "work_title": "15 Sinfonías — Invenciones a tres voces", "catalog": "BWV 787–801", "composer": "Johann Sebastian Bach", "composer_dates": "1685–1750", "year_composed": "1723 (versiones previas en el Clavier-Büchlein de 1720)", "period": "Barroco", "genre": "Teclado · contrapunto a tres voces", "style_notes": "Quince piezas en quince tonalidades, una por grado del ciclo ascendente: Do, do, Re, re, Mi♭, Mi, mi, Fa, fa, Sol, sol, La, la, Si♭, si. Tres voces obligadas de principio a fin.", "historical_context": "Bach las tituló Sinfonías en la copia en limpio de 1723; en el Clavier-Büchlein de Wilhelm Friedemann (1720) figuraban como Fantasías. La portada declara el propósito: una guía para tocar limpiamente a dos voces y, progresando, manejar correctamente tres partes obligadas — y sobre todo adquirir un estilo cantabile de ejecución.", "source": "Edición kern (humdrum-tools/inventions) — ver 15_Sinfonias-kern-fuentes.zip", "total_duration_sec": 1310, "movements": [{"number": 1, "title": "Sinfonia 1 en Do mayor", "catalog": "BWV 787", "bar": 1, "bars": [1, 21], "key": "Do mayor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 92, "duration_sec": 55, "tonal_center": {"key": "C", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 2, "title": "Sinfonia 2 en do menor", "catalog": "BWV 788", "bar": 22, "bars": [22, 53], "key": "do menor", "time_signature": "12/8", "bpm_ref": 120, "duration_sec": 96, "tonal_center": {"key": "C", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 3, "title": "Sinfonia 3 en Re mayor", "catalog": "BWV 789", "bar": 54, "bars": [54, 78], "key": "Re mayor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 92, "duration_sec": 65, "tonal_center": {"key": "D", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 4, "title": "Sinfonia 4 en re menor", "catalog": "BWV 790", "bar": 79, "bars": [79, 101], "key": "re menor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 80, "duration_sec": 69, "tonal_center": {"key": "D", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 5, "title": "Sinfonia 5 en Mi bemol mayor", "catalog": "BWV 791", "bar": 102, "bars": [102, 139], "key": "Mi bemol mayor", "time_signature": "3/4", "bpm_ref": 60, "duration_sec": 114, "tonal_center": {"key": "E", "alt": "b", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 6, "title": "Sinfonia 6 en Mi mayor", "catalog": "BWV 792", "bar": 140, "bars": [140, 180], "key": "Mi mayor", "time_signature": "9/8", "bpm_ref": 180, "duration_sec": 62, "tonal_center": {"key": "E", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 7, "title": "Sinfonia 7 en mi menor", "catalog": "BWV 793", "bar": 181, "bars": [181, 224], "key": "mi menor", "time_signature": "3/4", "bpm_ref": 52, "duration_sec": 152, "tonal_center": {"key": "E", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 8, "title": "Sinfonia 8 en Fa mayor", "catalog": "BWV 794", "bar": 225, "bars": [225, 247], "key": "Fa mayor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 92, "duration_sec": 60, "tonal_center": {"key": "F", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 9, "title": "Sinfonia 9 en fa menor", "catalog": "BWV 795", "bar": 248, "bars": [248, 282], "key": "fa menor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 48, "duration_sec": 175, "tonal_center": {"key": "F", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 10, "title": "Sinfonia 10 en Sol mayor", "catalog": "BWV 796", "bar": 283, "bars": [283, 315], "key": "Sol mayor", "time_signature": "3/4", "bpm_ref": 99, "duration_sec": 60, "tonal_center": {"key": "G", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 11, "title": "Sinfonia 11 en sol menor", "catalog": "BWV 797", "bar": 316, "bars": [316, 387], "key": "sol menor", "time_signature": "3/8", "bpm_ref": 80, "duration_sec": 81, "tonal_center": {"key": "G", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 12, "title": "Sinfonia 12 en La mayor", "catalog": "BWV 798", "bar": 388, "bars": [388, 418], "key": "La mayor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 92, "duration_sec": 81, "tonal_center": {"key": "A", "alt": "n", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 13, "title": "Sinfonia 13 en la menor", "catalog": "BWV 799", "bar": 419, "bars": [419, 482], "key": "la menor", "time_signature": "3/8", "bpm_ref": 60, "duration_sec": 96, "tonal_center": {"key": "A", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}, {"number": 14, "title": "Sinfonia 14 en Si bemol mayor", "catalog": "BWV 800", "bar": 483, "bars": [483, 506], "key": "Si bemol mayor", "time_signature": "4/4", "bpm_ref": 92, "duration_sec": 63, "tonal_center": {"key": "B", "alt": "b", "mode": 0}}, {"number": 15, "title": "Sinfonia 15 en si menor", "catalog": "BWV 801", "bar": 507, "bars": [507, 544], "key": "si menor", "time_signature": "9/16", "bpm_ref": 63, "duration_sec": 81, "tonal_center": {"key": "B", "alt": "n", "mode": 1}}]}, "spacing": {"h": 1, "v": 1, "byM": {}}, "view": {"zoom": 65, "barNums": "continuous", "listenOct": {"fit": 5, "start": 1}, "page": {"fit": "auto", "staff": "5", "sysGap": "8", "pages": "0", "mode": "ancho", "paper": "A4", "footer": true, "pageNum": true}}, "alteration": "b", "a4": 440, "tempo": 78, "timeSignature": {"num": 4, "den": 4}, "subDiv": 1, "totalMeasures": 35, "barlines": {"35": {"id": "final"}}, "repeatMarks": [], "repeatSections": [], "_sectionSeq": 0, "showRepeatSections": true, "anacrusis": null, "groups": [{"showBarLines": true, "id": 1786990000100, "type": "brace", "channels": [0, 1, 2]}], "scoreInfo": {"title": "Sinfonía nº 9 en fa menor", "subtitle": "BWV 795 · Harpsichord (Tonal)", "composer": "Johann Sebastian Bach", "author": "", "copyright": "J. S. Bach, BWV 787-801 — dominio público. Codificación **kern: Craig Stuart Sapp, humdrum-tools/inventions (2024), sobre la Bach-Gesellschaft Ausgabe, Band 3, Breitkopf & Härtel, Leipzig 1853. Dinámicas, ligados y articulaciones: Music Motion, 2026 — edición para piano.", "file": "15_Sinfonias_BWV_787-801", "print": {}}, "tempoMarkings": [{"measure": 1, "beatPos": 0, "term": "Andante espre